                  "body": "{\n    \"remark\": \"success\",\n    \"status\": 200,\n    \"AddedCourseID\": {\n        \"pageTitle\": \"Webinars\",\n        \"webinars\": [\n            {\n                \"id\": 1995,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1016,\n                \"creator_id\": 1016,\n                \"category_id\": 611,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Become-a-Project-Manager\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 150,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/product-management-.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/product-management.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jk-JwtScIlw&pp=ygUScHJvamVjdCBtYW5hZ2VtZW50\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1624867858,\n                \"updated_at\": 1711967895,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 1,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 1995,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Become a Project Manager\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"The most complete course available on Project Management.\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.25em; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">The most updated and comprehensive Project Management course on Udemy! You'll learn the skills that encompass the entire Project Management role and process: from project initiation to planning, from stakeholder analysis to risk management, from scheduling to budgeting, and from execution to monitoring and controlling. We also include real-world case studies, interactive exercises, and downloadable resources to enhance your learning experience.</p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">Currently, there are over 3,000+ job listings worldwide seeking Project Managers, offering competitive salaries averaging $100,000 / year.</p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">The demand for Project Management is rapidly increasing as organizations recognize the critical role it plays in achieving successful outcomes.</p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">But how do you break into the field? There are no specific degrees or certifications for Project Management, and many Project Managers enter the field through chance or connections. That changes here - we'll equip you with all the essential skills needed for Project Management and give you the best chance of securing your desired job. No more guesswork - we'll provide you with clear guidance on what you need to learn and what steps to take, all from an experienced Project Management professional.</p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">Students are not required to have prior knowledge - we'll cover the basics, teach you how to apply them effectively, help you advance your project management skills, and ultimately, maximize your opportunities for landing a job as a Project Manager.</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: inherit; max-width: 118.4rem;\\\"><br style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(60, 59, 55); font-family: \\\" sf=\\\"\\\" pro=\\\"\\\" text\\\",=\\\"\\\" -apple-system,=\\\"\\\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\\\"\\\" roboto,=\\\"\\\" \\\"segoe=\\\"\\\" ui\\\",=\\\"\\\" helvetica,=\\\"\\\" arial,=\\\"\\\" sans-serif,=\\\"\\\" \\\"apple=\\\"\\\" color=\\\"\\\" emoji\\\",=\\\"\\\" ui=\\\"\\\" symbol\\\";=\\\"\\\" font-size:=\\\"\\\" 14px;\\\"=\\\"\\\"></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 1996,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1015,\n                \"creator_id\": 1015,\n                \"category_id\": 601,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Master-the-Fundamentals-of-Math\",\n                \"start_date\": 1728570600,\n                \"duration\": 450,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/math.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/mathh.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6EjEorados&list=PLOxODW9vlVLQpGF3aHZ5CrrRH5bbmN2kP4\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 100,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 1,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"Can I add a new session to my class after it is published?\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1624943782,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713347525,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 2,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 1996,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Master the Fundamentals of Math\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Master the Fundamentals of Math\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">In this course, participants will delve into the core principles of mathematics, covering topics such as numbers and operations, algebraic expressions, geometry, measurement, functions and graphs, statistics, probability, and problem-solving strategies. Through a combination of theoretical explanations, practical examples, and hands-on exercises, students will gain a deep understanding of each concept and its real-world applications.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">The course begins with an exploration of the number system, including natural numbers, integers, fractions, decimals, and their properties. Participants will learn how to perform basic arithmetic operations and solve problems involving numerical expressions. Moving on to algebraic expressions, students will discover the power of variables and equations, learning techniques to simplify expressions and solve linear equations and inequalities.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Geometry will be a key focus, where learners will delve into the properties of geometric shapes, measurement, and spatial relationships. They will explore concepts such as perimeter, area, volume, and angles, as well as geometric transformations and the Pythagorean theorem. Through interactive activities and visualizations, students will develop a strong intuition for geometric concepts.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">The course will also cover functions and graphs, providing a solid introduction to fundamental functions such as linear and quadratic functions. Participants will learn how to graph functions, analyze their behavior, and solve equations graphically. Additionally, they will explore statistical concepts, including data representation, measures of central tendency, and probability theory, gaining practical skills for interpreting and analyzing data.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Throughout the course, an emphasis will be placed on problem-solving strategies, empowering students to approach mathematical problems with confidence and creativity. They will learn how to dissect complex problems, identify relevant information, and apply appropriate mathematical techniques to find solutions. Real-world applications and examples will be integrated to demonstrate the relevance of mathematical concepts in everyday life and various fields, including science, engineering, finance, and technology.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">By the end of the course, participants will have mastered the fundamental concepts of mathematics and developed critical thinking skills essential for success in higher-level mathematics courses and professional endeavors. Whether they are preparing for standardized tests, pursuing further studies in STEM disciplines, or simply seeking to enhance their mathematical literacy, this course will provide a solid foundation for their mathematical journey.</font></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 1997,\n                \"teacher_id\": 934,\n                \"creator_id\": 934,\n                \"category_id\": 602,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Fundamentals-Of-Physics\",\n                \"start_date\": 1713715200,\n                \"duration\": 180,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/fizik.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/fizik (2).jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b1t41Q3xRM8\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 15,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"thank you .\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1624954285,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713346759,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 3,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 1997,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Fundamentals Of Physics\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Fundamentals Of Physics\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Physics, often called the fundamental science, seeks to understand the fundamental principles governing the behavior of matter, energy, space, and time. The course \\\"Fundamentals of Physics\\\" serves as an introduction to the foundational concepts and principles that underpin this vast field of study. Through a blend of theoretical exploration, practical experimentation, and real-world applications, students will embark on a journey to unravel the mysteries of the physical world around them.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">This course begins by laying the groundwork with an exploration of measurement and units, teaching students the language and tools necessary for precise quantitative analysis. From there, students delve into the core principles of motion, force, and energy, as described by Newton's laws of motion and the principles of conservation. Through engaging demonstrations and problem-solving exercises, students will gain a deep understanding of how objects move, interact, and transform energy within various physical systems.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">As the course progresses, students will explore the fascinating realms of fluid mechanics, thermodynamics, electricity, and magnetism. They will uncover the underlying principles governing the behavior of fluids, the transfer of heat, and the interaction of electric and magnetic fields. Through hands-on laboratory experiments and theoretical exploration, students will gain insight into the mechanisms that drive these phenomena and their practical applications in everyday life and cutting-edge technologies.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Moreover, this course will introduce students to the profound implications of modern physics, including the theory of relativity, quantum mechanics, and nuclear physics. By examining these revolutionary theories, students will develop a deeper appreciation for the interconnectedness of the physical universe and the remarkable power of human intellect to comprehend its mysteries.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Throughout the course, emphasis will be placed on critical thinking, problem-solving skills, and scientific inquiry. Students will learn to analyze complex phenomena, formulate hypotheses, and test their understanding through experimentation and observation. By the end of the course, students will have acquired a solid foundation in the principles of physics, preparing them for further study in STEM disciplines and equipping them with the tools to engage with and contribute to the ever-evolving field of physics.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --t