A4eWskrc\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 10,\n                \"price\": 30,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1625044975,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713342173,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 6,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2000,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"The Art of Effective Time Management\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"How Entrepreneurs and Small Business Owners can Get 10X More Done in Half of the Time\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"font-size: 14px; max-width: 118.4rem;\\\" sf=\\\"\\\" pro=\\\"\\\" text\\\",=\\\"\\\" -apple-system,=\\\"\\\" blinkmacsystemfont,=\\\"\\\" roboto,=\\\"\\\" \\\"segoe=\\\"\\\" ui\\\",=\\\"\\\" helvetica,=\\\"\\\" arial,=\\\"\\\" sans-serif,=\\\"\\\" \\\"apple=\\\"\\\" color=\\\"\\\" emoji\\\",=\\\"\\\" ui=\\\"\\\" symbol\\\";\\\"=\\\"\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">In a world where time is one of our most valuable resources, mastering the art of effective time management is essential for success in both personal and professional endeavors. \\\"The Art of Effective Time Management\\\" is a comprehensive course designed to equip individuals with the tools and techniques necessary to maximize productivity, minimize stress, and achieve their goals with greater efficiency.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Through a combination of theoretical insights, practical strategies, and interactive exercises, participants will embark on a journey to unlock their full potential and reclaim control over their time. This course goes beyond simple tips and tricks, delving deep into the psychology and principles underlying effective time management practices.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Participants will learn how to identify common time-wasting activities, overcome procrastination, and eliminate distractions that derail their focus. They will explore various prioritization techniques, such as the Eisenhower Matrix and the Pareto Principle, to ensure that they are investing their time and energy in activities that align with their goals and values.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">\\\"The Art of Effective Time Management\\\" empowers individuals to develop personalized time management plans tailored to their unique needs and preferences. From setting SMART goals to creating daily schedules and implementing time-blocking strategies, participants will gain practical skills that they can apply immediately to enhance their productivity and effectiveness.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Moreover, this course equips participants with the resilience and adaptability needed to navigate the challenges of modern life, including interruptions, multitasking, and unexpected demands on their time. By cultivating a mindset of mindfulness and intentionality, participants will learn how to maintain balance and prioritize self-care amidst their busy schedules.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Whether you're a busy professional striving for greater work-life balance, a student juggling academic deadlines and extracurricular activities, or an entrepreneur seeking to optimize your business operations, \\\"The Art of Effective Time Management\\\" offers invaluable insights and guidance to help you thrive in today's fast-paced world.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Join us on this transformative journey and unlock the secrets to mastering time, achieving your goals, and living a more fulfilling life.</font></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2001,\n                \"teacher_id\": 3,\n                \"creator_id\": 3,\n                \"category_id\": 606,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Learn-Angular-From-Scratch\",\n                \"start_date\": 1722520800,\n                \"duration\": 60,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/angular.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/angularr.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3qBXWUpoPHo\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 85,\n                \"price\": 30,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 1,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"I corrected the session dates. Thanks\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1625074163,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713341628,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 7,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2001,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Learn Angular From Scratch\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Learn Angular From Scratch\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Are you eager to dive into modern web development and create dynamic, interactive web applications? Look no further than our comprehensive \\\"Learn Angular From Scratch\\\" course! Angular is one of the most popular frameworks for building single-page applications, and this course is your ultimate guide to mastering it from the ground up.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Whether you're a seasoned developer looking to expand your skill set or a complete beginner in web development, this course is designed to cater to all skill levels. You'll start by setting up your development environment and creating your first Angular project using Angular CLI. From there, you'll embark on a journey through the core concepts and features of Angular, gradually building up your expertise.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Through a combination of in-depth theoretical explanations, hands-on coding exercises, and real-world examples, you'll gain a solid understanding of Angular's building blocks, including components, templates, data binding, services, and directives. You'll learn how to manage data effectively, handle user input with forms, and navigate between different parts of your application using Angular Router.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">As you progress through the course, you'll explore advanced Angular topics such as dependency injection, observables and RxJS, and best practices for performance optimization and code organization. You'll also discover how to test your Angular applications thoroughly and deploy them to production environments with confidence.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">But learning Angular isn't just about mastering the framework itself—it's also about adopting a mindset of continuous improvement and staying up-to-date with the latest tools and techniques. That's why this course goes beyond the basics to cover advanced topics like state management, Angular CLI tips and tricks, and industry best practices.</font></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" style=\\\"\\\">By the end of the course, you'll have not only the knowledge but also the practical skills to build professional-quality Angular applications from scratch. Whether you're aspiring to become a front-end developer, enhance your career prospects, or simply embark on a new learning journey, \\\"Lear