  \"slug\": \"How-to-Become-a-Great-Listener\",\n                \"start_date\": 1720443600,\n                \"duration\": 270,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/listener.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/listener.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i3ku5nx4tMU\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 55,\n                \"price\": 40,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 730,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"I modified the files again. Thanks\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1625299225,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713340885,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 9,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2003,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"How to Become a Great Listener\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"How to Become a Great Listener\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Effective listening is more than just hearing words; it's about truly understanding the message being conveyed. In this course, you will embark on a journey to master the art of listening and transform the way you engage with others.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Becoming a great listener is not only beneficial in personal relationships but also essential for success in professional settings. Whether you're a leader looking to inspire your team, a colleague striving to collaborate more effectively, or an individual seeking deeper connections with friends and family, this course will equip you with the skills and mindset needed to excel.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-posit