r: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Through a series of comprehensive modules, participants will embark on a journey to grasp the core principles, methodologies, and tools essential for DevOps success. The course begins with an exploration of the fundamental concepts of DevOps, elucidating its evolution, significance, and impact on modern software development practices.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Participants will delve deeper into the DevOps culture, emphasizing collaboration, communication, and the integration of development and operations teams. They will learn how continuous integration (CI), continuous deployment (CD), automation, and measurement contribute to fostering a culture of agility, innovation, and continuous improvement.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">The course then transitions into a discussion of the core principles of DevOps, including infrastructure as code (IaC), microservices architecture, containerization, continuous testing, delivery, and monitoring. Participants will gain practical insights into the key technologies and tools that enable the implementation of DevOps practices, such as Git, Jenkins, Docker, Kubernetes, and Prometheus.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">With a focus on practical application, participants will learn how to assess existing infrastructure and processes, build DevOps pipelines, automate deployment processes, and implement continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) pipelines. They will also explore strategies for monitoring, feedback loops, and scaling DevOps practices across organizations.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Upon completion of \\\"The DevOps Essentials\\\" course, participants will emerge equipped with the knowledge, skills, and confidence to navigate the intricacies of DevOps and drive organizational success in today's dynamic digital landscape. Whether you're a software developer, IT professional, or organizational leader, this course empowers you to harness the power of DevOps to accelerate innovation, enhance collaboration, and deliver value to your customers with unparalleled efficiency.</font></span></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2006,\n                \"teacher_id\": 923,\n                \"creator_id\": 867,\n                \"category_id\": 604,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"How-to-Travel-Around-the-World\",\n                \"start_date\": 1646197200,\n                \"duration\": 150,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/travel (2).jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/travel.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1pkXk6-OnM\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 5,\n                \"price\": 25,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 1,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"I edited the text of the course. Thank\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1625693895,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713294413,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 12,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2006,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"How to Travel Around the World With Low Budget\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"How to Travel Around the World With Low Budget\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Are you dreaming of exploring the world but worried about the hefty price tag attached to global adventures? Look no further! Our comprehensive course on \\\"How to Travel Around the World With Low Budget\\\" is your ultimate guide to experiencing the wonders of the world without breaking the bank.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Designed for aspiring adventurers and seasoned travelers alike, this course equips you with the essential tools, strategies, and mindset needed to embark on budget-friendly journeys to destinations near and far. From navigating the labyrinth of budget airlines to uncovering hidden gems in budget accommodations, we cover every aspect of budget travel to ensure you can explore the world on your terms, without compromising on experiences.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\">Led by seasoned travelers and budget travel experts, each module of the course delves into practical tips, insider hacks, and real-life anecdotes to inspire and empower you to embark on unforgettable adventures without draining your savings. Whether you're a solo backpacker, a budget-conscious family, or a group of friends seeking thrifty travel options, this course caters to travelers of all backgrounds and interests.</font></span></p><p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gra