        \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1714392337,\n                \"updated_at\": 1714558019,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 177,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2029,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Learn Adjectives\",\n                        \"seo_description\": null,\n                        \"description\": \"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(236, 236, 236); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\\\">Unlock the power of descriptive language with our comprehensive English lesson on adjectives. Dive into the world of adjectives, those versatile words that add color, depth, and detail to your writing. Whether you're a beginner or looking to brush up on your skills, this lesson will guide you through the fundamentals of adjectives, including their types, usage, and placement within sentences. Learn how to choose the perfect adjectives to vividly paint scenes, evoke emotions, and capture the essence of your subject matter. With practical examples and engaging exercises, you'll gain the confidence to wield adjectives with precision and flair in your writing. Join us on this journey to elevate your language and express yourself with clarity and creativity.</span><br></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2031,\n                \"te