          \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1086/wise.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1086/wise.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IjftaVbPOyU\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": 20,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 1,\n                \"subscribe\": 1,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 10,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"is_draft\",\n                \"created_at\": 1714759129,\n                \"updated_at\": 1716490171,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 194,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2046,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Yapay Zeka ile Photoshop Egitimi\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Photoshop, ChatGPT, Tasarim\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p><font style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\"><font style=\\\"vertical-align: inherit;\\\">Tdgdg sdfgsdfgdsgdsfgsdfgdsfg</font></font></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2050,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1114,\n                \"creator_id\": 1114,\n                \"category_id\": 618,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Art-of-Bug-Finding-Software-Testing-Training\",\n                \"start_date\": 1714795200,\n                \"duration\": 45,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"testing.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"testing.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=38NHe7PZ54I&t=89s\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 10,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 0,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1714799381,\n                \"updated_at\": 1715033193,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 195,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2050,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Art of Bug Finding: Software Testing Training\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Step into the world of software testing! Learn fundamental testing skills with the 'Art of Bug Finding: Software Testing Training' course. Gain experience with real-world projects and specialize in the field of software testing.\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">     Software testing is a critical stage in the software development process, ensuring the release of error-free products into the market. The 'Art of Bug Finding: Software Testing Training' course provides participants with a solid foundation in software testing concepts, methodologies, and tools, making it ideal for anyone looking to understand software testing principles.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">     The course covers fundamental testing principles, test planning, test design, automation testing, and bug tracking. Participants will gain practical experience by working on real-world projects and practicing various test scenarios to enhance their skills.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">     The training is supported by expert instructors who provide interactive lessons, practical examples, and group exercises. Students are guided at every step, fostering their ability to identify and resolve their own mistakes. Additionally, the course content includes the latest industry trends and best practices.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">     Upon completion of the course, participants will feel more confident in managing software testing processes, detecting and reporting bugs. They will have also honed a crucial skill for gaining a competitive edge in the business world.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">     In conclusion, the 'Art of Bug Finding: Software Testing Training' course offers an excellent opportunity for those aspiring to build a career in software testing or professionals looking to enhance their existing skills. Through this course, participants can establish a strong foundation and step confidently into a successful future in the world of software testing.</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><br></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><br></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><br></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"><br></span></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2052,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1107,\n                \"creator_id\": 1107,\n                \"category_id\": 602,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Ilk-kursum\",\n                \"start_date\": 1714795200,\n                \"duration\": 3,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1107/online-course-platform-cover-1110x420.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1107/online-course-platform-cover-1110x420.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LFwHI7urDMg\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"is_draft\",\n                \"created_at\": 1714845845,\n                \"updated_at\": 1714845898,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n           