 ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2065,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1084,\n                \"creator_id\": 1084,\n                \"category_id\": 603,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Learn-French-in-10-steps\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 50,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/product-management-.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1084/abstract-purple-fluid-wave-background-free-vector.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://youtu.be/ujDtm0hZyII?si=4F-qjaUBLKmuiATI\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"upload\",\n                \"capacity\": 5,\n                \"price\": 99,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1715010708,\n                \"updated_at\": 1715011859,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 206,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2065,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Learn French in 10 steps\",\n                        \"seo_description\": null,\n                        \"description\": \"<p>You can learn French in 10 steps! It's possible!</p><p><br></p><p>Lets take a look of how we can do that!</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>As beginners we do think learning a new language is almost impossible in short time. But have you tried these 10 steps that also helped me gain discipline and learn any other languages? If no theres a chance of you to do that, lets take a look at whats inside.</p><p><br></p><p>What i teach in this course is those 10 steps and how youre going to keep up and establish discipline.</p><p>The important thing here is not the 10 magical steps but the discipline that you will build. And no i guarantee it will be so fun , you will forget the word 'boring' . You will love to continue and by the time you will realise youre already disciplined. After that everything is simple. 10 Steps are the cherry on the top!</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2071,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1119,\n                \"creator_id\": 1119,\n                \"category_id\": 622,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"pilates\",\n                \"start_date\": 1715227200,\n                \"duration\": 15,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1119/IMG_4331.PNG\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1119/IMG_4331.PNG\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-nVUFwavuFY\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"upload\",\n                \"capacity\": 5,\n                \"price\": 20,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\