erve as the guardians of software quality, advocating for a culture of quality assurance and automation within organizations. By combining their technical expertise with a passion for delivering high-quality software, SDETs play a pivotal role in driving innovation, mitigating risks, and enhancing customer satisfaction in today's fast-paced software development environment.</font></span></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2022,\n                \"teacher_id\": 934,\n                \"creator_id\": 934,\n                \"category_id\": 613,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Cyber-Security\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 90,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/cyber-security-.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/cyber-security.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=shQEXpUwaIY\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"youtube\",\n                \"capacity\": 25,\n                \"price\": 55,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 1,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 365,\n                \"points\": 3,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": \"Thank you for reviewing.\",\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1678910860,\n                \"updated_at\": 1713270803,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 170,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2022,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Cyber Security\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Installment payment is a popular method of paying for goods and services that allows customers to spread out the cost of a purchase over a period of time.\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p style=\\\"border: 0px solid rgb(227, 227, 227); --tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\\"Noto Sans\\\", sans-serif, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\", \\\"Noto Color Emoji\\\"; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse