0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1734117624,\n                \"updated_at\": null,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 777,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2654,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Health And Fitness4\",\n                        \"seo_description\": null,\n                        \"description\": \"desc\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2657,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1602,\n                \"creator_id\": 1602,\n                \"category_id\": 620,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Yazlm-ereniyorum\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 60,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1602/f3253bcd8fcb99e7ec69a9839451bb37.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1602/f3253bcd8fcb99e7ec69a9839451bb37.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": null,\n                \"video_demo_source\": null,\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": 150,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 10,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750438181,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750438222,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 780,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2657,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Yazılım Öğreniyorum\",\n                        \"seo_description\": null,\n                        \"description\": \"<p data-start=\\\"261\\\" data-end=\\\"339\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"261\\\" data-end=\\\"339\\\">Yazılım Dünyasına Güçlü Bir Adım Atmak İsteyenler İçin Yepyeni Bir Fırsat!</strong></p><p data-start=\\\"341\\\" data-end=\\\"769\\\">Teknoloji hızla gelişiyor ve bu gelişime ayak uydurabilmek, hatta öncüsü olabilmek artık bir ayrıcalıktan çok bir gereklilik haline geldi. Yeni açılan yazılım kursumuz, bu değişimin bir parçası olmak isteyen herkese kapılarını açıyor! İster üniversite öğrencisi olun, ister kariyerine yeni bir yön vermek isteyen bir profesyonel, ister sıfırdan başlayıp yazılım alanında uzmanlaşmak isteyen bir girişimci; bu kurs tam size göre!</p><p>\\r\\n\\r\\n</p><p data-start=\\\"771\\\" data-end=\\\"1301\\\">Kursumuzda, yazılım dünyasına dair hem teorik hem de pratik bilgileri bir arada sunuyoruz. Temel algoritma ve programlama mantığından başlayarak, Python, JavaScript, HTML-CSS, React ve SQL gibi güncel teknolojilere kadar geniş bir yelpazede eğitim veriyoruz. Proje tabanlı eğitim modelimiz sayesinde, katılımcılar öğrendiklerini gerçek dünya projeleri üzerinde uygulama fırsatı buluyor. Bu sayede yalnızca kod yazmayı değil, aynı zamanda problem çözmeyi, ekip çalışmasını ve yazılım geliştirme süreçlerini de öğrenmiş oluyorsunuz.</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2658,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1589,\n                \"creator_id\": 1589,\n                \"category_id\": 618,\n                \"type\": \"webinar\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"API-and-Postman-Trainer\",\n                \"start_date\": 1750489200,\n                \"duration\": 565,\n                \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\",\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1589/API.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1589/Software Logo.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MFxk5BZulVU\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"upload\",\n                \"capacity\": 10,\n                \"price\": 220,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750465864,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750466959,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 781,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2658,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"API and Postman Trainer\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"\\\"API geliştirme ve Postman kullanımı üzerine kapsamlı eğitimiyle, yazılım becerilerinizi ileri seviyeye taşıyın. Uygulamalı örneklerle öğrenin!\\\"\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p>\\\"API geliştirme ve Postman eğitimiyle yazılım dünyasında fark yaratın. Temelden ileri seviyeye uygulamalı içeriklerle öğrenin, projelerinizi güçlendirin.\\\"</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2659,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1589,\n                \"creator_id\": 1589,\n                \"category_id\": 621,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Salkl-Beslenme\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 250,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1589/Beslenme ve Diyet.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1589/Software Logo.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": null,\n                \"video_demo_source\": null,\n                \"capacity\": 50,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 1,\n                \"subscribe\": 1,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750466772,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750466870,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 782,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2659,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Sağlıklı Beslenme\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"\\\"Sağlıklı beslenme alışkanlıklarıyla enerjinizi artırın, bağışıklığınızı güçlendirin. Dengeli diyet önerileri ve pratik ipuçlarıyla yaşam kalitenizi yükseltin.\\\"\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p>\\\"Sağlıklı beslenme rehberimizle dengeli diyetin sırlarını keşfedin. Bilimsel temelli öneriler ve günlük yaşamınıza kolayca uyarlanabilir ipuçlarıyla daha enerjik bir hayata adım atın.\\\"</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2660,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1605,\n                \"creator_id\": 1605,\n                \"category_id\": null,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Postman\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": null,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"360x260px\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"1920x520px\",\n                \"video_demo\": null,\n                \"video_demo_source\": null,\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": null,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750531245,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750531282,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 783,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2660,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"Postman\",\n                        \"seo_description\": null,\n                        \"description\": \"<p>It is a training that teaches the processes of creating, testing, using and managing APIs (Application Programming Interfaces).<br></p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2661,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1608,\n                \"creator_id\": 1608,\n                \"category_id\": 613,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Gevenlii\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 150,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1608/webdriverIO.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1608/API.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": null,\n                \"video_demo_source\": null,\n                \"capacity\": 250,\n                \"price\": 1000,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 0,\n                \"downloadable\": 0,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 1,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": 3250,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750541568,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750541640,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 784,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2661,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"İş Güvenliği\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"Jira ve Xray kullanarak test yönetimini öğrenin. Test senaryosu yazımı, manuel ve otomasyon testi süreçlerini optimize etmek için eğitime katılın.\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p>ssss</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2662,\n                \"teacher_id\": 1603,\n                \"creator_id\": 1603,\n                \"category_id\": 606,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"How-To-Create-Node-js-Website\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 42,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1603/NodeJs-Debug-min.png\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1603/NodeJs-Debug-min.png\",\n                \"video_demo\": \"/store/1603/NodeJs-Debug-min.png\",\n                \"video_demo_source\": \"upload\",\n                \"capacity\": null,\n                \"price\": 19.99,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 1,\n                \"certificate\": 1,\n                \"downloadable\": 1,\n                \"partner_instructor\": 0,\n                \"subscribe\": 0,\n                \"forum\": 0,\n                \"enable_waitlist\": 0,\n                \"access_days\": null,\n                \"points\": null,\n                \"message_for_reviewer\": null,\n                \"status\": \"active\",\n                \"created_at\": 1750603662,\n                \"updated_at\": 1750603890,\n                \"deleted_at\": null,\n                \"title\": null,\n                \"description\": null,\n                \"seo_description\": null,\n                \"translations\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": 785,\n                        \"webinar_id\": 2662,\n                        \"locale\": \"en\",\n                        \"title\": \"How To Create Node.js Website\",\n                        \"seo_description\": \"How to Learn Node.js is a beginner-friendly course designed to guide you step-by-step through the world of server-side JavaScript development. Whether you're just getting started with programming or looking to expand your skills beyond frontend, this course provides clear explanations, practical projects, and essential concepts to help you understand how Node.js works and how to use it effectively. By the end, you’ll be confident in building your own backend applications and working with tools like Express, file systems, and REST APIs.\",\n                        \"description\": \"<p><em data-start=\\\"146\\\" data-end=\\\"168\\\">How to Learn Node.js</em> is a beginner-friendly course designed to guide you step-by-step through the world of server-side JavaScript development. Whether you're just getting started with programming or looking to expand your skills beyond frontend, this course provides clear explanations, practical projects, and essential concepts to help you understand how Node.js works and how to use it effectively. By the end, you’ll be confident in building your own backend applications and working with tools like Express, file systems, and REST APIs.</p>\"\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"id\": 2663,\n                \"teacher_id\": 870,\n                \"creator_id\": 1349,\n                \"category_id\": null,\n                \"type\": \"course\",\n                \"private\": 0,\n                \"slug\": \"Health-And-Fitness4-174\",\n                \"start_date\": null,\n                \"duration\": 60,\n                \"timezone\": null,\n                \"thumbnail\": \"/store/1/product-management-.jpg\",\n                \"image_cover\": \"/store/1/product-management.jpg\",\n                \"video_demo\": null,\n                \"video_demo_source\": null,\n                \"capacity\": 5,\n                \"price\": 20,\n                \"organization_price\": null,\n                \"support\": 0,\n             